### Patron endpoints

### The line for table 1 (current player + waiting list)
GET http://localhost:8080/tables/1/reservations

### My role for table 1 (CURRENT / CHECK_IN / NEXT / WAITING / NONE)
POST http://localhost:8080/tables/1/reservations/role
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "seed-session-ada"
}

### Join the line for table 1
POST http://localhost:8080/tables/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerName": "Sam",
  "patronEmail": "sam@example.com"
}

### Join again with the same session = 400 "already in line"
POST http://localhost:8080/tables/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerName": "Sam",
  "patronEmail": "sam@example.com",
  "sessionId": "seed-session-ada"
}

### Join a table that doesn't exist = 404
POST http://localhost:8080/tables/999/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerName": "Sam",
  "patronEmail": "sam@example.com"
}

### Leave the line for table 1
DELETE http://localhost:8080/tables/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "seed-session-grace"
}

### Nudge the current player for table 1 (must be in line; pushes them a notification)
POST http://localhost:8080/tables/1/reservations/nudge
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "seed-session-grace"
}

### Check in and claim the table (must have an open 2-minute window)
POST http://localhost:8080/tables/1/reservations/check-in
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "seed-session-grace"
}

### Current player confirms they are still here
POST http://localhost:8080/tables/1/reservations/still-here
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "seed-session-ada"
}

### Current player gives up the table
POST http://localhost:8080/tables/1/reservations/give-up
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "seed-session-ada"
}
